    "questionEn": "The electric field in a region is given by E → = ( 2 i ˆ + 4 j ˆ + 6 k ˆ ) × 10 3 N / C . The flux of the field through a rectangular surface parallel to x − z plane is 6.0 Nm 2 C − 1 . The area of the surface is _____________ cm 2 .",
