    "questionEn": "Energy released when two deuterons ( 1 H 2 ) fuse to form a helium nucleus ( 2 He 4 ) is : (Given : Binding energy per nucleon of 1 H 2 = 1.1 MeV and binding energy per nucleon of 2 He 4 = 7.0 MeV )",
