    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "γ A is the specific heat ratio of monoatomic gas A having 3 translational degrees of freedom. γ B is the specific heat ratio of polyatomic gas B having 3 translational, 3 rotational degrees of freedom and 1 vibrational mode. If γ A γ B = ( 1 + 1 n ) , then the value of n is ________ .",
