    "questionEn": "The width of one of the two slits in Young's double slit experiment is d while that of the other slit is x d . If the ratio of the maximum to the minimum intensity in the interference pattern on the screen is 9 : 4 then what is the value of x ? (Assume that the field strength varies according to the slit width.)",
