    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "A light hollow cube of side length 10 cm and mass 10 g , is floating in water. It is pushed down and released to execute simple harmonic oscillations. The time period of oscillations is y π × 10 − 2 s , where the value of y is (Acceleration due to gravity, g = 10 m / s 2 , density of water = 10 3 kg / m 3 )",
