    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let z 1 , z 2 and z 3 be three complex numbers on the circle | z | = 1 with arg ⁡ ( z 1 ) = − π 4 , arg ⁡ ( z 2 ) = 0 and arg ⁡ ( z 3 ) = π 4 . If | z 1 z ̄ 2 + z 2 z ̄ 3 + z 3 z ̄ 1 | 2 = α + β √ 2 , α , β ∈ Z , then the value of α 2 + β 2 is :",
