    "questionEn": "A spherical liquid drop of radius R acquires the terminal velocity v 1 when falls through a gas of viscosity η . Now the drop is broken into 64 identical droplets and each droplet acquires terminal velocity v 2 falling through the same gas. The ratio of terminal velocities v 1 / v 2 is _ _ _ _ .",
