    "questionEn": "A square loop of side 2 cm is placed in a time varying magnetic field with magnitude as B = 0.4 sin ⁡ ( 300 t ) Tesla. The normal to the plane of loop makes an angle of 60 ∘ with the field. The maximum induced emf produced in the loop is _ _ _ _ mV .",
