    "questionEn": "A data consists of 20 observations x 1 , x 2 , ... , x 20 . If ∑ i = 1 20 ( x i + 5 ) 2 = 2500 and ∑ i = 1 20 ( x i − 5 ) 2 = 100 , then the ratio of mean to standard deviation of this data is :",
