    "questionEn": "Let chord PQ of length 3 √ 13 of the parabola y 2 = 12 x be such that the ordinates of points P and Q are in the ratio 1:2. If the chord PQ subtends an angle α at the focus of the parabola, then sin ⁡ α is equal to :",
