    "questionEn": "If the eccentricity e of the hyperbola x 2 a 2 − y 2 b 2 = 1 , passing through ( 6 , 4 √ 3 ) , satisfies 15 ( e 2 + 1 ) = 34 e , then the length of the latus rectum of the hyperbola x 2 b 2 − y 2 2 ( a 2 + 1 ) = 1 is:",
