    "questionEn": "Let the centre of the circle x 2 + y 2 + 2 g x + 2 f y + 25 = 0 be in the first quadrant and lie on the line 2 x − y = 4 . Let the area of an equilateral triangle inscribed in the circle be 27 √ 3 . Then the square of the length of the chord of the circle on the line x = 1 is _ _ _ _ .",
