    "questionEn": "The density ρ of a uniform cylinder is determined by measuring its mass m , length l and diameter d . The measured values of m , l and d are 97.42 ± 0.02 g , 8.35 ± 0.05 mm and 20.20 ± 0.02 mm , respectively. Calculated percentage fractional error in ρ is _ _ _ _ .",
