    "questionEn": "A three coulomb charge moves from the point ( 0 , − 2 , − 5 ) to the point ( 5 , 1 , 2 ) in an electric field expressed as E ⃗ = 2 x i ˆ + 3 y 2 j ˆ + 4 k ˆ N / C . The work done in moving the charge is _ _ _ _ J.",
