    "questionEn": "The reaction A ( g ) ⇌ B ( g ) + C ( g ) was initiated with the amount ' a ' of A ( g ) . At equilibrium it is found that the amount of A ( g ) remaining is ( a − x ) at a total pressure of p . The equilibrium constant Kp of the reaction can be calculated from the expression :",
