    "questionEn": "Consider the following data for the reaction X 2 ( g ) + Y 2 ( g ) ⇌ 2 X Y ( g ) at 600 K ∘ . The Δ r G ⊖ (in kJ mol − 1 ) for the reaction is : Compound Δ f H ⊖ 600 K ( kJ mol − 1 ) S ⊖ 600 K ( J mol − 1 K − 1 ) XY ( g ) 42 200 X 2 ( g ) 8 140 Y 2 ( g ) 80 250",
