    "questionEn": "Let f : [ 1 , ∞ ) → R be a differentiable function defined as f ( x ) = ∫ x 1 f ( t ) dt + ( 1 − x ) ( log e ⁡ x − 1 ) + e . Then the value of f ( f ( 1 ) ) is :",
