    "questionEn": "Let f ( x ) and g ( x ) be twice differentiable functions satisfying f ′ ′ ( x ) = g ′ ′ ( x ) for all x ∈ R , f ′ ( 1 ) = 2 g ′ ( 1 ) = 4 and g ( 2 ) = 3 f ( 2 ) = 9 . Then f ( 25 ) − g ( 25 ) is equal to :",
