    "questionEn": "Assuming the experimental mass of 12 6 C as 12 u , the mass defect of 12 6 C atom is _ _ _ _ MeV / c 2 . (Mass of proton = 1.00727 u . mass of neutron = 1.00866 u , 1 u = 931.5 MeV / c 2 and c is the speed of the light in vacuum).",
