    "questionEn": "A particle of charge q and mass m is projected from origin with an initial velocity v ⃗ = ( v 0 √ 2 x ˆ + v 0 √ 2 y ˆ ) . There exists a uniform magnetic field B ⃗ = B 0 z ˆ and a space varying electric field E ⃗ = E o e − λ x x ˆ within the region 0 ⩽ x ⩽ L . After travelling a distance such that x -coordinate has changed from x = 0 to x = L , the change in the kinetic energy is _ _ _ _ .",
