    "questionEn": "Let tan ⁡ A , tan ⁡ B , where A , B ∈ ( − π 2 , π 2 ) , be the roots of the quadratic equation x 2 − 2 x − 5 = 0 . Then 20 sin 2 ⁡ ( A + B 2 ) is equal to:",
