    "questionEn": "Let a focus of the ellipse E : x 2 a 2 + y 2 b 2 = 1 be S ( 4 , 0 ) and its eccentricity be 4 5 . If the point P ( 3 , α ) lies on E and O is the origin, then the area of △ POS is equal to:",
