    "questionEn": "Consider the following statements: A. Zeroth law of thermodynamics gives concept of temperature B. First law of thermodynamics gives concept of internal energy C. In isothermal expansion of ideal gas, Δ Q ≠ Δ W D. Product of intensive and extensive variables is extensive E. The ratio of any extensive variable to mass will be an extensive variable Choose the correct combination of statements from the options given below:",
