    "questionEn": "Let for some α ∈ R , f : R → R be a function satisfying f ( x + y ) = f ( x ) + 2 y 2 + y + α x y for all x , y ∈ R . If f ( 0 ) = − 1 and f ( 1 ) = 2 , then the value of ∑ n = 1 5 ( α + f ( n ) ) is :",
