    "questionEn": "From a month of 31 days, 3 different dates are selected at random. If the probability that these dates are in an increasing A.P. is equal to a b , where a , b ∈ N and gcd ⁡ ( a , b ) = 1 , then a + b is equal to _ _ _ _",
