    "questionEn": "In a double slit experiment, when one of the slits is covered by a transparent mica sheet of refractive index 1.56 , the central fringe shifts to the position of 7 th bright fringe, obtained with both slits uncovered. If the light source wavelength is 450 nm , the thickness of mica sheet is α × 10 − 9 m . The value of α is _ _ _ _ .",
