    "questionEn": "Suppose that two chords, drawn from the point ( 1 , 2 ) on the circle x 2 + y 2 + x − 3 y = 0 are bisected by the y -axis. If the other ends of these chords are R and S , and the mid point of the line segment RS is ( α , β ) , then 6 ( α + β ) is equal to :",
