    "questionEn": "Suppose that the mean and median of the non-negative numbers 21 , 8 , 17 , a , 51 , 103 , b , 13 , 67 , ( a > b ) , are 40 and 21 , respectively. If the mean deviation about the median is 26 , then 2 a is equal to :",
