    "shift": 2,
    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : Among Zn, Mn, Sc and Cu, the energy required to remove the third valence electron is highest for Zn and lowest for Sc. Statement II : The correct order of the following complexes in terms of CFSE is [ Co(H 2 O ) 6 ] 2 + [ Co(H 2 O ) 6 ] 3 + [ Co(en) 3 ] 3 + . In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
