    "questionEn": "If a body of mass 1 kg falls on the earth from infinity, it attains velocity ( v ) and kinetic energy ( k ) on reaching the surface of earth. The values of v and k respectively are __________. (Take radius of earth to be 6400 km and g = 9.8 m/s 2 )",
