    "questionEn": "For reaction A → P, rate constant k = 1.5 × 10 3 s − 1 at 27 ∘ C If activation energy for the above reaction is 60 kJ mol − 1 , then the temperature (in ∘ C ) at which rate constant, k = 4.5 × 10 3 s − 1 is ______. (Nearest integer) Given : log ⁡ 2 = 0.30 , log ⁡ 3 = 0.48 , R = 8.3 J K − 1 mol − 1 , ln ⁡ 10 = 2.3",
