    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let A , B and C be three 2 × 2 matrices with real entries such that B = ( I + A ) − 1 and A + C = I . If BC = [ 1 − 5 − 1 2 ] and CB [ x 1 x 2 ] = [ 12 − 6 ] , then x 1 + x 2 is",
