    "questionEn": "Consider the following three statements for the function f : ( 0 , ∞ ) → R defined by f ( x ) = | log e ⁡ x | − | x − 1 | : (I) f is differentiable at all x > 0 . (II) f is increasing in ( 0 , 1 ) . (III) f is decreasing in ( 1 , ∞ ) . Then.",
