    "questionEn": "The hydrogen spectrum consists of several spectral lines in Lyman series ( L 1 , L 2 , L 3 ... ; L 1 has lowest energy among Lyman series). Similarly it consists of several spectral lines in Balmer series ( B 1 , B 2 , B 3 ... ; B 1 has lowest energy among Balmer lines). The energy of L 1 is x times the energy of B 1 . The value of x is _ _ _ _ × 10 − 1 . (Nearest integer)",
