    "questionEn": "Two masses 400 g and 350 g are suspended from the ends of a light string passing over a heavy pulley of radius 2 cm . When released from rest the heavier mass is observed to fall 81 cm in 9 s . The rotational inertia of the pulley is _ _ _ _ kg ⋅ m 2 . ( g = 9.8 m / s 2 )",
