    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Three masses 200 kg , 300 kg and 400 kg are placed at the vertices of an equilateral triangle with sides 20 m . They are rearranged on the vertices of a bigger triangle of side 25 m and with the same centre. The work done in this process _ _ _ _ J. (Gravitational constant G = 6.7 × 10 − 11 N m 2 / kg 2 )",
