    "questionEn": "A cylindrical conductor of length 2 m and area of cross-section 0.2 mm 2 carries an electric current of 1.6 A when its ends are connected to a 2 V battery. Mobility of electrons in the conductor is α × 10 − 3 m 2 / V . s . The value of α is : (electron concentration = 5 × 10 28 / m 3 and electron charge = 1.6 × 10 − 19 C )",
