    "questionEn": "Match the LIST-I with LIST-II List-I | List-II | A. | Spring constant | I. | ML2T−2K−1 | B. | Thermal conductivity | II. | ML0T−2 | C. | Boltzmann constant | III. | ML2T−3A−2 | D. | Inductive reactance | IV. | MLT−3K−1 | Choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
