    "questionEn": "A cylindrical tube A B of length l , closed at both ends contains an ideal gas of 1 mol having molecular weight M . The tube is rotated in a horizontal plane with constant angular velocity ω about an axis perpendicular to A B and passing through the edge at end A , as shown in the figure. If P A and P B are the pressures at A and B respectively, then (Consider the temperature is same at all points in the tube)",
