    "questionEn": "Three identical coils C 1 , C 2 and C 3 are closely placed such that they share a common axis. C 2 is exactly midway. C 1 carries current I in anti-clockwise direction while C 3 carries current I in clockwise direction. An induced current flows through C 2 will be in clockwise direction when",
