    "questionEn": "The minimum frequency of photon required to break a particle of mass 15.348 amu into 4 α particles is _ _ _ _ kHz . [mass of He nucleus = 4.002 amu , 1 amu = 1.66 × 10 − 27 kg , h = 6.6 × 10 − 34 J . s and c = 3 × 10 8 m / s ]",
