    "questionEn": "The volume of an ideal gas increases 8 times and temperature becomes ( 1 / 4 ) th of initial temperature during a reversible change. If there is no exchange of heat in this process ( Δ Q = 0 ) then identify the gas from the following options (Assuming the gases given in the options are ideal gases) :",
