    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : The correct order in terms of atomic/ionic radii is Al > Mg > Mg 2+ > Al 3+ . Statement II : The correct order in terms of the magnitude of electron gain enthalpy is Cl > Br > S > O. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
