    "shift": 2,
    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : The correct order in terms of bond dissociation enthalpy is Cl 2 > Br 2 > F 2 > I 2 . Statement II : The correct trend in the covalent character of the metal halides is [SnCl 4 > SnCl 2 ], [PbCl 4 > PbCl 2 ] and [UF 4 > UF 6 ]. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
