    "questionEn": "A point charge of 10 − 8 C is placed at origin. The work done in moving a point charge 2 μ C from point A ( 4 , 4 , 2 ) m to B ( 2 , 2 , 1 ) m is _ _ _ _ J. ( 1 4 π ε o = 9 × 10 9 in SI units)",
