    "questionEn": "At room temperature ( 27 ∘ C ) , the resistance of a heating element is 50 Ω . The temperature coefficient of the material is 2.4 × 10 − 4 ∘ C − 1 . The temperature of the element, when its resistance is 62 Ω , is __________ ∘ C .",
