    "shift": 1,
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let a , b and c denote the outcome of three independent rolls of a fair tetrahedral die, whose four faces are marked 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 . If the probability that a x 2 + b x + c = 0 has all real roots is m n , gcd ⁡ ( m , n ) = 1 , then m + n is equal to _________.",
