    "questionEn": "Δ vap H ⊖ for water is + 40.79 kJ mol − 1 at 1 bar and 100 ∘ C . Change in internal energy for this vapourisation under same condition is ________ kJ mol − 1 . (Integer answer) (Given R = 8.3 JK − 1 mol − 1 )",
