    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "An electron with kinetic energy 5 eV enters a region of uniform magnetic field of 3 μ T perpendicular to its direction. An electric field E is applied perpendicular to the direction of velocity and magnetic field. The value of E, so that electron moves along the same path, is __________ NC − 1 . (Given, mass of electron = 9 × 10 − 31 kg , electric charge = 1.6 × 10 − 19 C )",
