    "questionEn": "Suppose for a differentiable function h , h ( 0 ) = 0 , h ( 1 ) = 1 and h ′ ( 0 ) = h ′ ( 1 ) = 2 . If g ( x ) = h ( e x ) e h ( x ) , then g ′ ( 0 ) is equal to:",
