    "questionEn": "In Franck-Hertz experiment, the first dip in the current-voltage graph for hydrogen is observed at 10.2 V . The wavelength of light emitted by hydrogen atom when excited to the first excitation level is ________ nm. (Given hc = 1245 eV nm , e = 1.6 × 10 − 19 C ).",
