    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : On passing HCl ( g ) through a saturated solution of BaCl 2 , at room temperature white turbidity appears. Statement II : When HCl gas is passed through a saturated solution of NaCl , sodium chloride is precipitated due to common ion effect. In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
