    "questionEn": "A solenoid of length 0.5 m has a radius of 1 cm and is made up of ' m ' number of turns. It carries a current of 5 A . If the magnitude of the magnetic field inside the solenoid is 6.28 × 10 − 3 T then the value of m is __________.",
