    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "The electric field between the two parallel plates of a capacitor of 1.5 μ F capacitance drops to one third of its initial value in 6.6 μ s when the plates are connected by a thin wire. The resistance of this wire is ________ Ω . (Given, log e ⁡ 3 = 1.1 )",
