    "shift": 2,
    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement (I) : A π bonding MO has lower electron density above and below the inter-nuclear axis. Statement (II) : The π ∗ antibonding MO has a node between the nuclei. In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
