    "questionEn": "The lines L 1 , L 2 , ... , L 20 are distinct. For n = 1 , 2 , 3 , ... , 10 all the lines L 2 n − 1 are parallel to each other and all the lines L 2 n pass through a given point P . The maximum number of points of intersection of pairs of lines from the set { L 1 , L 2 , ... , L 20 } is equal to ___________.",
