    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement (I) : The NH 2 group in Aniline is ortho and para directing and a powerful activating group. Statement (II) : Aniline does not undergo Friedel-Craft's reaction (alkylation and acylation). In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
