    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "A parallel plate capacitor has a capacitance C = 200 pF . It is connected to 230 V ac supply with an angular frequency 300 rad / s . The rms value of conduction current in the circuit and displacement current in the capacitor respectively are :",
