    "questionEn": "Two discs of moment of inertia I 1 = 4 kg m 2 and I 2 = 2 kg m 2 , about their central axes & normal to their planes, rotating with angular speeds 10 rad / s & 4 rad / s respectively are brought into contact face to face with their axes of rotation coincident. The loss in kinetic energy of the system in the process is _________ J.",
