    "questionEn": "A particle starts from origin at t = 0 with a velocity 5 i ˆ m / s and moves in x − y plane under action of a force which produces a constant acceleration of ( 3 i ˆ + 2 j ˆ ) m / s 2 . If the x -coordinate of the particle at that instant is 84 m , then the speed of the particle at this time is √ α m / s . The value of α is _________.",
