    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "In a nuclear fission process, a high mass nuclide ( A ≈ 236 ) with binding energy 7.6 MeV / Nucleon dissociated into middle mass nuclides ( A ≈ 118 ) , having binding energy of 8.6 MeV / Nucleon . The energy released in the process would be ______ MeV .",
