    "questionEn": "Consider the triangles with vertices A ( 2 , 1 ) , B ( 0 , 0 ) and C ( t , 4 ) , t ∈ [ 0 , 4 ] . If the maximum and the minimum perimeters of such triangles are obtained at t = α and t = β respectively, then 6 α + 21 β is equal to ___________.",
