    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "20 mL of 0.1 M NaOH is added to 50 mL of 0.1 M acetic acid solution. The pH of the resulting solution is ___________ × 10 − 2 (Nearest integer) Given : pKa ( CH 3 COOH ) = 4.76 log ⁡ 2 = 0.30 log ⁡ 3 = 0.48",
