    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "An atom absorbs a photon of wavelength 500 nm and emits another photon of wavelength 600 nm . The net energy absorbed by the atom in this process is n × 10 − 4 eV . The value of n is __________. [Assume the atom to be stationary during the absorption and emission process] (Take h = 6.6 × 10 − 34 Js and c = 3 × 10 8 m / s )",
