    "questionEn": "Let s 1 , s 2 , s 3 , ... , s 10 respectively be the sum to 12 terms of 10 A.P. s whose first terms are 1 , 2 , 3 , ... .10 and the common differences are 1 , 3 , 5 , ... ... , 19 respectively. Then ∑ i = 1 10 s i is equal to :",
