    "questionEn": "If f : R → R be a continuous function satisfying ∫ 0 π 2 f ( sin ⁡ 2 x ) sin ⁡ x d x + α ∫ 0 π 4 f ( cos ⁡ 2 x ) cos ⁡ x d x = 0 , then the value of α is :",
