    "questionEn": "Let w 1 be the point obtained by the rotation of z 1 = 5 + 4 i about the origin through a right angle in the anticlockwise direction, and w 2 be the point obtained by the rotation of z 2 = 3 + 5 i about the origin through a right angle in the clockwise direction. Then the principal argument of w 1 − w 2 is equal to :",
