    "questionEn": "A square loop of side 2.0 cm is placed inside a long solenoid that has 50 turns per centimetre and carries a sinusoidally varying current of amplitude 2.5 A and angular frequency 700 rad s − 1 . The central axes of the loop and solenoid coincide. The amplitude of the emf induced in the loop is x × 10 − 4 V . The value of x is __________. (Take, π = 22 7 )",
