    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements: One is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R. Assertion A: Butan -1- ol has higher boiling point than ethoxyethane. Reason R: Extensive hydrogen bonding leads to stronger association of molecules. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
