    "questionEn": "A current of 2 A flows through a wire of cross-sectional area 25.0 mm 2 . The number of free electrons in a cubic meter are 2.0 × 10 28 . The drift velocity of the electrons is __________ × 10 − 6 ms − 1 (given, charge on electron = 1.6 × 10 − 19 C ).",
