    "questionEn": "A small particle of mass m moves in such a way that its potential energy U = 1 2 m ω 2 r 2 where ω is constant and r is the distance of the particle from origin. Assuming Bohr's quantization of momentum and circular orbit, the radius of n th orbit will be proportional to,",
