    "questionEn": "A water heater of power 2000 W is used to heat water. The specific heat capacity of water is 4200 J kg − 1 K − 1 . The efficiency of heater is 70 % . Time required to heat 2 kg of water from 10 ∘ C to 60 ∘ C is _________ s. (Assume that the specific heat capacity of water remains constant over the temperature range of the water).",
